&lt;p&gt;I is not safe to stop node from the RingMessageWorker since stop method will interrupt and join RingMessageWorker thread, let&apos;s stop node from another thread.&lt;br/&gt;
Also please improve test to check that not only node left event was received, but Ignite instance was really stopped.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
